<title>CHINA: China oil firm welcomes disputed islands talks.</title>
<headline>China oil firm welcomes disputed islands talks.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's state-owned China National Offshore Oil Corporation on Thursday said it welcomed a call from a Japanese company to jointly develop a group of hotly disputed islands in the East China Sea.</p>
<p>&quot;We are, of course, willing to talk with Japan about joint oil exploration in the disputed islands again,&quot; a company official said by telephone.</p>
</text>
